    """A fact with no recorded filing date can never be PROVEN filed by as_of, so it is excluded
    rather than assumed safe -- the same 'absence is not sameness' rule already applied to
    provenance in `_ratio_continuity`. ISO 'YYYY-MM-DD' strings compare correctly as text."""
